silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_decomposition_step_1__step_glue__typedleg^n__>_freesigmaapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The symbol is called \"glue\". The arrow goes FROM a collection of n typed legs TO the Free(Sigma)-wrapped apex object. In the Kleisli category, this is the third and final pipeline arrow, after cite and type." .
